---
import Slide from "./Slide.astro";
---

<Slide id="top">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.55] no-print"
    style="background:
      radial-gradient(60rem 40rem at 70% -10%, rgba(91,140,255,0.10), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(50rem 40rem at 10% 10%, rgba(212,255,63,0.08), transparent 55%);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">AI Visibility · Founder-Led · Dubai &amp; Kochi</p>

    <h1 class="d-display reveal mt-5 max-w-[22ch] text-balance font-extrabold tracking-tightest">
      AI thought FUJIFILM's Nura was an anime character.<br />
      <span class="text-bone-300">Now it names Nura first.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="d-lead reveal mt-6 max-w-[62ch] text-bone-300 print-muted">
      Asked where to get an AI-powered health checkup in India, ChatGPT, Gemini
      and Google's AI Overview named Nura first. That's what NoorRank does: we
      make AI engines understand, trust and recommend your business to the
      right customers.
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="rounded-full bg-signal px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
      >
        See what AI says about you
      </a>
      <a
        href="#proof"
        class="rounded-full border border-bone-500/25 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-bone-100 transition-colors hover:border-bone-300"
      >
        See the proof →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Slide>
